# manuscript_assets/ is a read-only discovery-pass bundle: 222 of its 224
# files are byte-identical copies of files already tracked elsewhere in this
# repo (verified by content hash against the current worktree and, for a
# handful, against git history at their source branch) -- reconstructible,
# not tracked here. The tarball is fully derived from the directory.
# Two files are genuinely unique (curated/annotated content not derivable
# from any single tracked source) and are tracked explicitly below despite
# living under this ignored directory.
manuscript_assets.tar.gz
manuscript_assets/*
!manuscript_assets/MANIFEST.md
!manuscript_assets/source/
manuscript_assets/source/*
!manuscript_assets/source/phaseC-decomp__SOURCE_EXCERPTS.md
